WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
Today, in our Little Yellow Book,

2
00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.230
she's an inspiration to all of us.

3
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.877
You have her on your wall in your show. It's Oprah.

4
00:00:07.877 --> 00:00:09.998
(crowd cheers)
Oprah!

5
00:00:09.998 --> 00:00:11.539
Thank you, everyone.
Oprah?!

6
00:00:11.539 --> 00:00:13.089
I know, yeah, it's like, yeah!

7
00:00:13.089 --> 00:00:17.085
Oprah! Oprah! Oprah! Oprah! Oprah! Oprah!

8
00:00:17.085 --> 00:00:17.918
(laughs)

9
00:00:17.918 --> 00:00:21.040
I love that she said, "live your best life".

10
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.387
How clever is that? The turn of phrase,

11
00:00:23.387 --> 00:00:26.820
"your" makes it about you, and not about her.

12
00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:29.990
And now we have Oprah Daily, which is like,

13
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:32.100
lets you just know you can be on that feeder

14
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.320
and totally satisfied.

15
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:39.320
And she has a new digital series on the oprahdaily.com,

16
00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.770
called the "Oprah Daily Insiders Round Table".

17
00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.710
It's hosted by the one and only Gayle King,

18
00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:48.260 line:15%
who's a friend of the show.
Love Gayle.

19
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:52.150 line:15%
And mine, and with incredible guests like Glennon Doyle,

20
00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.160 line:15%
Ashley C. Ford, talking about the big issues.

21
00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.180 line:15%
Let's take a look.

22
00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:59.170
It's like, we have had time to think about who we are

23
00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:02.050
and what we want and what we will not accept anymore,

24
00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:05.060
whether it's stilettos or that jerk that we've been going

25
00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:06.650
to lunch with forever, for some reason.

26
00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.880
It's being fiercely on our own side,

27
00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.380
and not changing for the world,

28
00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:13.926
but like, changing our friends and our clothes to fit us.

29
00:01:13.926 --> 00:01:15.793
(crowd cheers)

30
00:01:15.793 --> 00:01:20.793
Huh, I feel like our conversations could cross over.

31
00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:22.720
A hundred thousand percent.

32
00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:26.150
Glennon Doyle kind of talking fun truths about fashion

33
00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:28.300
and relationships, and breaking it all down

34
00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:31.973
in a pithy, adorable, useful takeaway, way.

35
00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:36.310
I was... I'm on Oprah Daily,

36
00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:41.310
and she published her journal entry from the night before

37
00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.600
she started the Oprah Winfrey Show.

38
00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:44.810
Oh, wow!

39
00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:48.237
So, as a journalist...

40
00:01:48.237 --> 00:01:49.380
"Journalist".
(crowd laughs)

41
00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:53.150
I wanted to read that entry so badly.

42
00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:54.547
So I go to read it and they're like,

43
00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.640
"Oh, you have to be an Oprah Insider to get it."

44
00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.960
And I was like... (screams)

45
00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:00.640
So, are you an Oprah Insider?

46
00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.160
I want to be.
All right.

47
00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.930
Well, you can be.

48
00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:07.353
And we are thrilled because we are teaming up

49
00:02:07.353 --> 00:02:10.710
with Oprah Daily for an ongoing partnership.

50
00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:13.330
Oprah Daily editors will be sharing the latest

51
00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:16.840
Oprah Daily scoops here all season long,

52
00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:18.274
and we're kicking it off today!

53
00:02:18.274 --> 00:02:20.629
(crowd cheers and whoops)

54
00:02:20.629 --> 00:02:23.629
Oprah! Oprah! Oprah! Oprah! Oprah!

55
00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:29.748
You're all getting a free Oprah Daily Insider membership!

56
00:02:29.748 --> 00:02:32.331
(crowd cheers)

57
00:02:33.408 --> 00:02:37.575
Oprah! Oprah! Oprah! Oprah! Oprah! Oprah! Oprah!

58
00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:42.950
Whoo, go! That's a full year of the magazine, digital,

59
00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:46.710
and all the episodes of Oprah Daily Insiders Round Table,

60
00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:49.610 line:15%
special invites, so much more.

61
00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:51.350 line:15%
So I'm just... I'm thrilled.

62
00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.970 line:15%
I'm excited to spend every day with Oprah.

63
00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:55.610 line:15%
She is an icon.

64
00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.730 line:15%
But you're an icon, and I'm an icon,

65
00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:58.928 line:15%
and you're all icons!
(crowd cheers)

66
00:02:58.928 --> 00:03:00.801 line:15%
That's right!
Wow!

67
00:03:00.801 --> 00:03:04.810 line:15%
Ziwe Fumudoh, thank you for being the best co-pilot,

68
00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.910 line:15%
here today, on the news.

69
00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.493 line:15%
(upbeat music)

